# .delegateignore - paths the agent-delegate plugin must never send to the sandbox.
#
# The plugin snapshots every file that is not in .gitignore and uploads it to a
# remote sandbox, where a third-party model provider (Command Code) reads it.
# Anything below could hold client minutas, legal-case data or credentials.
#
# Syntax: one git glob pathspec per line, relative to the repo root; "#" starts
# a comment. "dir/**" excludes everything under dir. A bare name matches only
# at the repo root; use "**/name" to match at any depth.
#
# Note: the plugin already excludes .env*, *.pem, *.key and similar secret names
# at any depth. They are repeated here so this file stands on its own.

# --- Client / case data: never leaves this machine ---
leia-minutas-teste-mascaradas/**
minutas/**
data/**

# --- Legislation KB scratch folder (holds cf_account.txt and raw sources) ---
leia-kb-legislacao/**
**/cf_account*

# --- Untracked local projects and tooling in the main checkout ---
mcp-pangolin/**

# --- Secrets and local state ---
.env*
**/.env*
.planning/**
.beads/**
.repo-atlas/**
